{"id":"99cc98508e51c9ee","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-ordinal-analysis.md","title":"相对于记法系统的序数分析","display":"df-ordinal-analysis — 相对于记法系统的序数分析","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-ordinal-analysis","aliases":["91-df-ordinal-analysis","91-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal","91-df-ordinal-strength"],"display":"df-ordinal-analysis — 相对于记法系统的序数分析","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-strength]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-ordinal-analysis"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-ordinal-analysis</span><span>91-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal</span><span>91-df-ordinal-strength</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ordinal-analysis — 相对于记法系统的序数分析"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c87db4d1858a0009\" href=\"?note=c87db4d1858a0009\" title=\"91-df-truth-strength\">91-df-truth-strength</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-ordinal-analysis-—-相对于记法系统的序数分析-$\\mathrm{OrdAn}$\">df-ordinal-analysis — 相对于记法系统的序数分析 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrdAn}\">\\(\\mathrm{OrdAn}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span> (待分析理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(O,\\prec)\">\\((O,\\prec)\\)</span> (有效序数记法系统)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ot}(a)\">\\(\\operatorname{ot}(a)\\)</span> (记法 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 表示的序数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}(\\prec_a)\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}(\\prec_a)\\)</span> (相应初段的良基性断言)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec_a\\coloneqq\\prec\\upharpoonright\\{b\\in O\\mid b\\prec a\\}\">\\(\\prec_a\\coloneqq\\prec\\upharpoonright\\{b\\in O\\mid b\\prec a\\}\\)</span> (记法初段)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}analysis}\\vdash\n|\\mathcal T|_O\n\\coloneqq\n\\sup\n\\left\\{\n\\operatorname{ot}(a)\n\\mid\na\\in O\n\\land\n\\mathcal T\\vdash\\mathrm{WF}(\\prec_a)\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}analysis}\\vdash\n|\\mathcal T|_O\n\\coloneqq\n\\sup\n\\left\\{\n\\operatorname{ot}(a)\n\\mid\na\\in O\n\\land\n\\mathcal T\\vdash\\mathrm{WF}(\\prec_a)\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>该数值依赖记法系统、基础理论和良基性断言的表达。只有在共同校准下，\n序数大小才可作为证明强度比较的证据；不能无条件使用\n“序数越大，理论越强”的逆推。</p>\n<p>本目录采用的稳健校准是：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>理论</th>\n<th>算术/分层真理校准</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>PA、TB、UTB、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span></td>\n<td>同一算术后果层；PA 的常见序数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_0\">\\(\\varepsilon_0\\)</span></td>\n<td>后三者对 PA 保守</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FS</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span></td>\n<td>强于 PA、弱于 KF，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-不一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KF</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\\)</span></td>\n<td>不是把 KF 的序数直接写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_0\">\\(\\Gamma_0\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VF</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ID}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{ID}_1\\)</span></td>\n<td>严格强于 KF</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>表中后两行给出与标准参考理论的算术等价，而不是声称\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ID}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{ID}_1\\)</span> 本身就是一行即可读出的\n唯一序数记号。</p>\n<p>序数分析可以通过嵌入、切消或良基归纳提供相对一致性证明，但相同序数\n不自动蕴含逐句保守性或理论互译。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_0\">\\(\\Gamma_0\\)</span> 是传统预测性分析的重要\n基准，不是本目录所有真理理论的通用强度值。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-ordinal-analysis-—-相对于记法系统的序数分析-$\\mathrm{OrdAn}$","text":"df-ordinal-analysis — 相对于记法系统的序数分析 $\\mathrm{OrdAn}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-strength","status":"resolved","id":"c87db4d1858a0009","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-strength]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrdAn}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T","display":false},{"tex":"(O,\\prec)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ot}(a)","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WF}(\\prec_a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\prec_a\\coloneqq\\prec\\upharpoonright\\{b\\in O\\mid b\\prec a\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}analysis}\\vdash\n|\\mathcal T|_O\n\\coloneqq\n\\sup\n\\left\\{\n\\operatorname{ot}(a)\n\\mid\na\\in O\n\\land\n\\mathcal T\\vdash\\mathrm{WF}(\\prec_a)\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\varepsilon_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ID}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\varepsilon_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ID}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_0","display":false}],"bytes":1999,"backlinks":[{